# Allowlist for apps/web/Dockerfile (the build context is the repo root):
# the workspace's manifests, and the web app's own sources and the
# packages it builds from.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
# The build type-checks the tests' config too, which reads these
!vitest.shared.ts
!coverage-policy.json
# Settings → About shows it (packages/client/src/utils/changelog.ts)
!CHANGELOG.md
!apps/web/
!packages/client/
!packages/contracts/
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
